%% LSEG Deal-Level Decision Tree — materiality gate, the call, the three-lever risk triage, roll-up
%% v0.1 · conceptual · for validation · Viridian-proposed, not LSEG-ratified
%% Paste into Miro via Mermaid import. Fallback: change first line to "graph TD".
flowchart TD
  START(["Deal in Salesforce<br/>category / value / close month"]):::start
  MAT{"Material?<br/>above threshold (channel / region / business line)"}:::dec
  TAIL["Non-material tail<br/>Early Stage Pipeline Overlay (formulaic, greyed, not called deal-by-deal)"]:::tail
  CALL{"Set the in/out call<br/>default from category, forecaster can override"}:::dec
  COMMIT["Commit → IN the most-likely (full value)"]:::inn
  BEST["Best Case → OUT → upside range"]:::outn
  MATU["Material, can't Commit → OUT → upside range<br/>option: pool as a weighted, deal-backed set (OPEN — needs James/Ken sign-off)"]:::open
  TRIAGE{"Reflect reality:<br/>what kind of risk? (one risk, one lever)"}:::dec
  VAL["How BIG? scope/size risk<br/>ADJUST VALUE (500k → 250k)<br/>delta vs Salesforce = upside · never a probability haircut"]:::lever
  TIME["WHEN? timing risk<br/>CHANGE MONTH (Jul → Aug)<br/>delta vs SF close = timing shift"]:::lever
  SWING["WHETHER? all-or-nothing risk<br/>KEEP FULL VALUE + FLAG SWING<br/>in = downside floor / out = already upside"]:::flag
  ROLL["Rolls up to three numbers"]:::hub
  ML["MOST-LIKELY (submitted)<br/>= sum of deals IN, at adjusted value and month"]:::rml
  BESTN["BEST / upside<br/>= most-likely + Salesforce delta (raw CRM ceiling, itemised, deal-traceable)"]:::rbest
  WORST["WORST / downside<br/>= most-likely minus flagged IN-deals that could fail (swing flag is the only source)"]:::rworst

  START --> MAT
  MAT -->|No| TAIL
  MAT -->|Yes| CALL
  CALL --> COMMIT
  CALL --> BEST
  CALL --> MATU
  COMMIT --> TRIAGE
  BEST --> TRIAGE
  MATU --> TRIAGE
  TRIAGE --> VAL
  TRIAGE --> TIME
  TRIAGE --> SWING
  VAL --> ROLL
  TIME --> ROLL
  SWING --> ROLL
  ROLL --> ML
  ROLL --> BESTN
  ROLL --> WORST

  classDef start fill:#1F3864,stroke:#132444,color:#ffffff
  classDef dec fill:#FFF3D8,stroke:#C8922E,color:#5A3E0A
  classDef tail fill:#E7EDF5,stroke:#C6D2E4,color:#1F3864
  classDef inn fill:#E4F1EA,stroke:#2E8B57,color:#1E6B4E
  classDef outn fill:#DCE6F5,stroke:#5E82BE,color:#1F3864
  classDef open fill:#C9DCF2,stroke:#5E82BE,color:#1F3864,stroke-dasharray: 5 4
  classDef lever fill:#DCE6F5,stroke:#5E82BE,color:#1F3864
  classDef flag fill:#FCEBD0,stroke:#C8922E,color:#7A4E0A
  classDef hub fill:#EEF3FA,stroke:#B9C6DC,color:#1F3864
  classDef rml fill:#1E6B4E,stroke:#14503A,color:#ffffff
  classDef rbest fill:#DCE6F5,stroke:#5E82BE,color:#1F3864
  classDef rworst fill:#F8DAD5,stroke:#C0503C,color:#7A2318
